  "assessment": "Develop the accepted straight-sofa reception with one composed artwork / lamp / taller plant, useful bedroom storage and better room organization. Kitchen, bathrooms and all architecture remain unchanged.",
  "notes": [
    "King mattress1800 × 2000mm; manufacturer reference frame1870 × 2220mm. The viewer mesh and warm upholstery are generic, not an IKEA replica. Source: IKEA IDANÄS article90458947, local availability / finish TBD.",
    "Single-bed frames reserve1280 × 2100mm around1200 × 2000mm mattresses, an INFERRED allowance pending product choice. Bedroom2 desk is1000 × 600mm to preserve bed clearance.",
    "Master bench moved to the south wall:665mm approach; east main path1288mm. Closed master chest1000 × 400mm; bedroom1 closed cabinet1000 × 350mm with815mm front approach.",
    "Dressing:600mm wardrobe depths;1335mm between fronts. Bedroom1 wardrobe approach800mm is exactly at the study assumption and needs site/product tolerance. Bedroom2 wardrobe approach849mm.",
    "Private hall face clearance1027mm; no floor cabinets. A250mm cabinet would leave777mm. Mirror and lighting only; family linen stored in bedroom2.",
    "One taller reception plant; no extra seating group. Six dining seats remain3+3 on the long sides. Species, detailed furniture CAD and actual materials remain TBD.",
    "An island inside the enclosed kitchen leaves982mm for both aisles combined after a610mm counter and600mm island; reject in the locked layout. An open kitchen is a separate architectural option requiring explicit approval.",
    "Validation:126PASS /76WARN /0FAIL. Warnings include inherited bathroom/kitchen issues and close joinery/wall tolerances; this is not construction or appliance-installation approval."
  ]
